    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "The United Nations issued a report last week warning that humans are destroying nature at such a rate that life on Earth is at risk. When the report came out, it naturally  $ \\underline{26} $ headlines. But obviously it didn't hijack the news agenda in the manner of a major terrorist attack or  $ \\underline{27} $ of war.",
      "block_bbox": [
        172,
        897,
