        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "The report from the Intergovernmental Science-Policy Platform on Biodiversity and Ecosystem Services (IPBES) is clear on what's at  $ \\underline{28} $ and what needs to change. IPBES chair Robert Watson says the \"  $ \\underline{29} $ evidence\" an presents \"ominous (凶兆的) picture\" . \"The health of ecosystems on which we and all other species depend is  $ \\underline{30} $ more rapidly than ever, \" Robert Watson said. We are  $ \\underline{31} $ the very foundations of our economies , live-lihoods ,food security , health and quality of life worldwide. \" The report says it's not too late if we make\" transformative change\" — fundamental, system-wide reorganization — at every level from local to global , and we need to focus on how to make that happen.",
      "block_bbox": [
        172,
        1021,
        1019,
        1299
      ],
      "block_id": 19,
      "block_order": 20,
      "group_id": 19,
      "block_polygon_points": [
        [
          172.0,
